            "review_title": "Review at Truc Lam Quan",
            "review_text": "PavalikaV\nChennai (Madras), India575 contributions\n0\nDecent Veggie Option\nJan 2026 • Family\nVisited the restaurant in the last week of January 26 for 2days for Dinner.\nAmbiance: needs definite sprucing up of the entire facade, environment, walls. Thorough cleanliness of the reception area, area leading to the Kitchen and Washrooms is a must.\nService: bit of offish approach at the billing counter. Service is slow though there arent many guests. Needs to be prompt, attentive, and proactive. Needs to provide the food as required than having to just place all the items at once. No one around to enquire if the food is ok, if any thing can be improved or even if any other order is required.\nFood per se is delicious though, with decent portions.\nBilling is accurate. For 2 people in one dinner, it costed 160680VND.\nOverall its just OK experience.\nRead more\nWritten March 23, 2026",
